<title>ITALY: Italy BCI senior executive Beneduce dies.</title>
<headline>Italy BCI senior executive Beneduce dies.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enrico Beneduce, joint managing director of Italian banking group Banca Commerciale Italiana, died on Thursday, aged 57, after a long illness.</p>
<p>The bank did not give any further details.</p>
<p>Beneduce first started at BCI in 1964, moved onto the group's board in April 1994 and in the same month was appointed one of two managing directors at the bank.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
